# The cloud worker is not part of what we publish. Its source lives in the
# private swizzy-ai/morgana-server, and it stays on disk here so this is still
# a working pnpm workspace — `pnpm -r` picks it up locally, which is where the
# worker's own tests are meant to run. It is simply not tracked, and ci.yml
# fails if it reappears in a commit.
packages/morgana-server/

